0":{"c":"AAPL","form":"10-Q","filed":"2026-07-31"}},"finsights":{"AAPL":[{"topic":"fcf","text":"Free cash flow was $136 billion in FY2026: operating cash flow of $145 billion less capital spending of $9 billion (computed from two filed figures). That is 28.4% of revenue. In FY2021 it was $93 billion.","cites":["AAPL.ocf.2026","AAPL.capex.2026","AAPL.revenue.2026","AAPL.ocf.2021","AAPL.capex.2021"]},{"topic":"sbc","text":"Stock-based compensation was $13.8 billion in FY2026, 2.9% of revenue, against 2.2% in FY2021.","cites":["AAPL.sbc.2026","AAPL.revenue.2026","AAPL.sbc.2021","AAPL.revenue.2021"]},{"topic":"returns","text":"In FY2026 the company paid $86.4 billion to repurchase its own shares and $15.7 billion in dividends: $102 billion together (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["AAPL.buybacks.2026","AAPL.dividends.2026"]},{"topic":"quarter","text":"In the three months ended 2026-09-26 revenue was $114 billion (the fiscal year less its first nine months: computed from two filed figures), up 11.7% from $102 billion in the three months ended 2025-09-27.","cites":["AAPL.d.revenue.2025-09-28.2026-09-26","AAPL.d.revenue.2025-09-28.2026-06-27","AAPL.d.revenue.2024-09-29.2025-09-27","AAPL.d.revenue.2024-09-29.2025-06-28"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Over the four quarters to 2026-09-26 revenue added up to $479 billion (computed from five filed figures), operating income to $158 billion and net income to $132 billion.","cites":["AAPL.d.revenue.2025-09-28.2025-12-27","AAPL.d.revenue.2025-12-28.2026-03-28","AAPL.d.revenue.2026-03-29.2026-06-27","AAPL.d.revenue.2025-09-28.2026-09-26","AAPL.d.revenue.2025-09-28.2026-06-27","AAPL.d.opinc.2025-09-28.2025-12-27","AAPL.d.opinc.2025-12-28.2026-03-28","AAPL.d.opinc.2026-03-29.2026-06-27","AAPL.d.opinc.2025-09-28.2026-09-26","AAPL.d.opinc.2025-09-28.2026-06-27","AAPL.d.netinc.2025-09-28.2025-12-27","AAPL.d.netinc.2025-12-28.2026-03-28","AAPL.d.netinc.2026-03-29.2026-06-27","AAPL.d.netinc.2025-09-28.2026-09-26","AAPL.d.netinc.2025-09-28.2026-06-27"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $136 billion: operating cash flow of $145 billion less capital spending of $9 billion (computed from eight filed figures).","cites":["AAPL.d.ocf.2025-09-28.2025-12-27","AAPL.d.ocf.2025-09-28.2026-03-28","AAPL.d.ocf.2025-09-28.2026-06-27","AAPL.d.ocf.2025-09-28.2026-09-26","AAPL.d.capex.2025-09-28.2025-12-27","AAPL.d.capex.2025-09-28.2026-03-28","AAPL.d.capex.2025-09-28.2026-06-27","AAPL.d.capex.2025-09-28.2026-09-26"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $14.8 billion at the end of FY2026 (tagged ContractWithCustomerLiability), against $13.7 billion a year earlier.","cites":["AAPL.deferred.2026","AAPL.deferred.2025"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 167,000 in its own words. FY2026 revenue works out to about $2.9 million for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["AAPL.q.employees","AAPL.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2026 the balance sheet carried $36.3 billion in cash and cash equivalents and $20.4 billion in short-term investments, and $80.1 billion of debt as tagged (LongTermDebtNoncurrent + LongTermDebtCurrent + CommercialPaper). Debt less cash and short-term investments was $23.4 billion (computed from five filed figures).","cites":["AAPL.cash.2026","AAPL.sti.2026","AAPL.debtLong.2026","AAPL.debtCurrent.2026","AAPL.debtShort.2026"]}]},"fin":{"AAPL":{}},"quotes":{"AAPL.q.employees":{"c":"AAPL","kind":"employees","n":167000,"quote":"As of September 26, 2026, the Company had approximately 167,000 full-time equivalent employees.","source":"AAPL-0000320193-26-000026","section":"Item 1. Business","date":"2026-11-03","proof":"9d11b013980b79287d573c37737df3aa09efae55e9c51bce9859858e57d98a81"}}}